            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "glkssailor"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Our family loves this recipe! We serve it at many family gatherings. I usually make it as written, but last time we used 1 carton chocolate ice cream and 1 carton coffee and that was really amazing. It had a stronger mocha flavor. We generally skip the cool whip. This is plenty rich without it.",
            "datePublished": "2020-02-22T13:21:03.377Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "visaiah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "made this today for my Halloween party! Delicious and VERY decadent! I was surprised that the recipe didn't call for milk, but the flavors blended beautifully. I used coffee ice cream- It was a giant, delicious bowl tasted just like a Starbucks iced mocha. Will definitely make this again!",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-27T18:23:49.997Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
