              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "farmgirl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I also made this for my daughter's bridal shower, as did the original recipe contributor. And it was also a huge hit! Followed the recipe exactly as is. I had so many compliments, and this punch has become legendary in my daughter's circle of friends. I have been asked to share many, many times for special occasions.",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-06T15:29:43.677Z"
